+# Changes
+
+## Round 2
+
+Changes in `src/layer.mjs`:
+
+- A key whose value in `over` is `undefined` now counts as not given, at any
+  depth (including inside objects in arrays): base's value (a fresh copy) is
+  kept, and a key only `over` has with `undefined` does not appear in the
+  result. Only `over` is treated this way; `undefined` held by `base` is copied
+  as is.
+- `layer` now throws a `TypeError` when either argument holds anything that is
+  not plain data, wherever it sits (nested objects, inside arrays, in `base` or
+  `over`, even if the value would later be replaced). Functions, `Map`, `Set`,
+  `RegExp` and class instances are refused; primitives, `null`, `Date`, arrays
+  and plain objects are allowed.
+
+Tests added to `tests/layer.test.mjs`: one for undefined handling (the four
+quoted cases plus undefined inside nested and array objects) and one for
+non-plain data (all seven quoted cases plus a few more, and a check that dates
+still work).
+
+REVIEW.md findings addressed:
+
+- Undefined handling (4 failing cases): fixed as above.
+- Non-plain data must throw (7 failing cases): fixed as above.
+
+No finding was set aside. The checklist items were already satisfied and still are.
+
+## Round 1
+
+- Added `layer(base, over)` in `src/layer.mjs`.
+- Added `tests/layer.test.mjs` covering each checklist point.
+- Added a line under `## Unreleased` in `CHANGELOG.md`.
